# Auto commit and push

After completing code changes for the user, commit and push automatically without asking for confirmation.

- Push to `cursor/auth-context-signup-3bf1` (the Vercel deploy branch), not `main` or `clean-base`.
- Follow the git safety protocol: never commit secrets, never force-push, never skip hooks unless the user explicitly requests it.
- Use concise commit messages that explain why the change was made.
- Only skip commit/push when there are no changes, or when the user explicitly says not to commit.
